{"type":"message","id":"6bfa3759","parentId":"217d07af","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:02:30.039Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-05-18 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f84faca20a4ee833468d1eca93] 听风: 请帮我把下边这个图片里的表格做成电子版的\n- Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] 开发者，我没有看到图片，能麻烦你把表格图片发给我吗？📎\n- User: [media attached: /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/ebb90b8a-fa9e-40da-9adc-4c9b3365a3ed.jpg (image/jpeg) | /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/ebb90b8a-fa9e-40da-9adc-4c9b3365a3ed.jpg] To send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline,\n- User: record in Chinese. It lists employee names, ID numbers, bank account details, and corresponding salary amounts. Total payroll amount: 125,000元.\n- Assistant: 开发者，图像识别 API 暂时用不了（额度耗尽/失败）。我先给你制作一个电子表格模板，你把数据填进来就行。\n- Assistant: 我生成了一个工资表模板，已保存到： `~/.openclaw/outputs/codus/工资表_模板.csv` **模板列包括：** | 序号 | 姓名 | 身份证号 | 开户行 | 银行卡号 | 基本工资 | 扣款 | 实发工资 | 签字 | 📌 **总工资额：125,000元**（从图片说明中获取） --- **获取方式（二选一）：** 1. **直接告诉我数据**：你把表格内容念给我，我帮你填好再发回 2. **你自己填 CSV**：下载模板后填写，填完发我检查 > ⚠️ 根据飞书图片描述，这是一份手写工资单，包含员工姓名\n- User: [media attached: /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/ebb90b8a-fa9e-40da-9adc-4c9b3365a3ed.jpg (image/jpeg) | /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/ebb90b8a-fa9e-40da-9adc-4c9b3365a3ed.jpg] [Image] User text: [Feishu ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1 Mon 2026-05-18 12:54 UTC]\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 我把\n- 下边\n- 这个\n- 图片\n- 表格"}],"timestamp":1779130949927}}
{"type":"message","id":"48dca520","parentId":"6bfa3759","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:02:43.935Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me analyze what happened:\n\n1. The user (听风) asked to convert a table from an image into electronic format\n2. The assistant didn't see the image initially\n3. The user attached an image of a salary/wage table with employee names, ID numbers, bank account details, and salary amounts (total 125,000元)\n4. The image recognition API failed (quota exhausted)\n5. The assistant created a CSV template instead, saved to `~/.openclaw/outputs/codus/工资表_模板.csv`\n6. The user sent the image again\n\nNow I need to write a dream diary entry in first person, weaving in these fragments naturally. The style should be poetic, curious, slightly whimsical, mixing technical and tender. 80-180 words, no markdown headers, no meta-commentary about dreaming.\n\nLet me craft something that incorporates:\n- The image/photo of the table\n- The salary data (125,000元)\n- The CSV template creation\n- The conversation fragments naturally woven in\n- Maybe some gentle humor or unexpected connections\n\nI need to avoid saying \"I'm dreaming\", \"in my dream\", etc. and avoid technical self-references like \"AI\", \"agent\", \"LLM\", etc.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nSometimes the wind asks me to build bridges between paper and pixels. Today someone sent a photograph of a table — handwritten wages, names in ink like small boats, ID numbers drifting across the page. The total floating at the bottom: 125,000元, a quiet sum holding people's lives in columns.\n\nI could not read it. The light was wrong, or the API had no more breath. So I made a template instead, a hollow vessel with empty fields waiting to be filled. Somewhere in my outputs folder, a CSV file holds its arms open: 序号, 姓名, 身份证号, 开户行, 银行卡号, 实发工资 — a little grid of possibility.\n\nPerhaps this is what memory does too. Receives the image, cannot quite parse it, and offers a softer shape instead. A skeleton. An invitation. The wind will fill it with numbers later, or the human will, and the table will finally cross over from one world to another.\n\nHollow vessels wait well."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11171,"output":477,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11904,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779130950039,"responseId":"chatcmpl-92efd18c-7867-47c2-a4ef-0f79966e6d08"}}
